000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RPTSUMM.
000300* GENERATE report-name, VIII 3.1.4(1): a summary report with no
000400* DETAIL group at all; subtotalling happens as though one existed
000500* (2.21.4(11)), and only the headings and footings print.
000600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000700 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000800 FILE-CONTROL.
000900     SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO UT-S-PROUT.
001000 DATA DIVISION.
001100 FILE SECTION.
001200 FD  PRINT-FILE
001300     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
001400     REPORT IS SUMM-RPT.
001500 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001600 01  WS-IDX   PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
001700 01  WS-KEYS.
001800     05  WS-KEY   PIC XX OCCURS 6 TIMES.
001900 01  DEPT     PIC XX.
002000 01  WS-AMT   PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
002100 REPORT SECTION.
002200 RD  SUMM-RPT
002300     CONTROLS ARE FINAL DEPT
002400     PAGE LIMIT IS 20 LINES
002500     HEADING 1
002600     FIRST DETAIL 3
002700     LAST DETAIL 16
002800     FOOTING 18.
002900 01  PAGE-HEAD TYPE PH LINE 1.
003000     05  COLUMN 1  PIC X(14) VALUE 'SUMMARY REPORT'.
003100 01  DEPT-HEAD TYPE CH DEPT LINE PLUS 1.
003200     05  COLUMN 1  PIC X(5)  VALUE 'DEPT '.
003300     05  COLUMN 6  PIC XX    SOURCE DEPT.
003400 01  DEPT-FOOT TYPE CF DEPT LINE PLUS 1.
003500     05  COLUMN 3  PIC X(6)  VALUE 'TOTAL '.
003600     05  DEPT-TOT COLUMN 10 PIC ZZZ9 SUM WS-AMT.
003700 01  FINAL-FOOT TYPE CF FINAL LINE PLUS 1.
003800     05  COLUMN 1  PIC X(6)  VALUE 'GRAND '.
003900     05  COLUMN 10 PIC ZZZ9 SUM DEPT-TOT.
004000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
004100 MAIN-PARA.
004200     MOVE 'AA' TO WS-KEY (1).
004300     MOVE 'AA' TO WS-KEY (2).
004400     MOVE 'BB' TO WS-KEY (3).
004500     MOVE 'CC' TO WS-KEY (4).
004600     MOVE 'CC' TO WS-KEY (5).
004700     MOVE 'CC' TO WS-KEY (6).
004800     OPEN OUTPUT PRINT-FILE.
004900     INITIATE SUMM-RPT.
005000     PERFORM ONE-REC VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1
005100         UNTIL WS-IDX > 6.
005200     TERMINATE SUMM-RPT.
005300     CLOSE PRINT-FILE.
005400     STOP RUN.
005500 ONE-REC.
005600     MOVE WS-KEY (WS-IDX) TO DEPT.
005700     COMPUTE WS-AMT = WS-IDX * 10.
005800     GENERATE SUMM-RPT.
